# Baseline projects: keep the decisions, drop the generated bulk.
#
# This directory is a reference copy, not a build. Only the files that record a RASC choice
# are tracked; see README.md here for the list. A secure project is about 630 files and this
# leaves about 23 of them.
#
# If you open the solution in e2 studio and generate, the rules below keep the output out of
# the repository, so the baseline stays a baseline.

# Generated by RASC from configuration.xml plus the FSP pack. Reproducible from what is
# tracked here, so pointless to store a second time.
*/ra/
*/ra_gen/
*/ra_cfg/

# Build output. The repository root .gitignore already covers Debug/; repeated here so this
# directory stands on its own.
*/Debug/
*/Release*/
*.o
*.elf
*.map

# e2 workspace noise.
*/.settings/org.eclipse.core.resources.prefs
.metadata/
